      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "beat": 7
      },
      "text": "MoviePass, August 2017: $9.95 a month, unlimited.\n\"It's just a price \u2014 we can change it back.\"\nYou cannot. Once a million people anchor on $9.95, raising it\nreturns you to a smaller, angrier company.",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MoviePass, August 2017: $9.95 a month, unlimited.\n\"It's just a price \u2014 we can change it back.\"\nYou cannot. Once a million people anchor on $9.95, raising it\nreturns you to a smaller, angrier company.",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "baseline": 15
    },
    {
      "id": "mpn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 460,
      "y": 796,
      "width": 700,
      "height": 60,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#4b5563",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 341345464,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1213442572,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "customData": {
        "beat": 7
      },
      "text": "A price cut is a one-way door. Cost of revenue that year: 197%\n\u2014 $2.00 spent for every $1.00 collected. The year before: 72%,\nand the business made a gross profit.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "A price cut is a one-way door. Cost of revenue that year: 197%\n\u2014 $2.00 spent for every $1.00 collected. The year before: 72%,\nand the business made a gross profit.",
